{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Kronecker","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Trace","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.MarkovTraceMultiplicative"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtrDiag_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtrDiag_one","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/QuantumTraceTower.lean#L79-L87","doc":"**The loop tower: `qtr(1) = [2]^n`.** The free-strand factor at every `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtrDiag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtrDiag","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/QuantumTraceTower.lean#L74-L77","doc":"Diagonal quantum trace on `n` strands: `qtrDiag X = ∑_f (∏ i μ(f i))·X_{f,f}`, indexed by the\nspin configurations `f : Fin n → Fin 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.sum_muDiag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.sum_muDiag","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/QuantumTraceTower.lean#L70-L72","doc":"The sum of the μ-weights over one strand is `[2] = q + 1/q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.muDiag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.muDiag","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/QuantumTraceTower.lean#L67-L68","doc":"The diagonal μ-weight on one strand: `μ = diag(q, 1/q)` as a function `Fin 2 → K`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtr_kron_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtr_kron_one","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/QuantumTraceTower.lean#L61-L65","doc":"The weight factorises on the identity: `qtr_{D₁⊗D₂}(1) = qtr_{D₁}(1)·qtr_{D₂}(1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtr_kron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtr_kron","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/QuantumTraceTower.lean#L47-L59","doc":"**Kronecker multiplicativity of the quantum trace.** Disjoint strand blocks factor:\n`qtr_{D₁⊗D₂}(X₁⊗X₂) = qtr_{D₁}(X₁)·qtr_{D₂}(X₂)`.\n\nThe μ-weighted case reduces to the canonical plain-trace multiplicativity\n`QOU.MathlibExt.MarkovTraceMultiplicative.trace_kron`: pull the two products through\n`Matrix.mul_kronecker_mul` (`(D₁⊗ₖD₂)·(X₁⊗ₖX₂) = (D₁·X₁)⊗ₖ(D₂·X₂)`), then apply `trace_kron`. One\ntrace-multiplicativity lemma serves both this tower and the mass/binding Markov-trace compute. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtr_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtr_one","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/QuantumTraceTower.lean#L42-L45","doc":"`qtr D 1 = tr D`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.QuantumTraceTower.qtr","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/QuantumTraceTower.lean#L39-L40","doc":"Weighted quantum trace `qtr D X = tr(D · X)`; `D` is the diagonal μ-weight. ","signatureChunk":0}]}